# Local development template — see .env.example for the full, commented list.
# Copy .env.example to .env.local and fill it in. Do NOT commit .env.local.
#
# Production: set every variable in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
#
# Minimum to boot chat:
#   FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT   Firebase Admin SDK private key (single-line JSON)
#   TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY       32+ random chars
#   OPENROUTER_API_KEY         OpenRouter key (free-tier ":free" models work)
#
# Optional — Orin AI router (OmniRoute instance):
#   ROUTER_BASE_URL            e.g. https://your-omniroute-instance.up.railway.app
#   ROUTER_API_KEY             API key generated in your OmniRoute dashboard
# When ROUTER_BASE_URL is set, all text traffic routes through it automatically.
